<title>PERU: Spain's Mapfre buys Peru insurance firm.</title>
<headline>Spain's Mapfre buys Peru insurance firm.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish insurance company Corporacion Mapfre Cia Internacional de Reaseguros bought a 51 percent stake in Peruvian firm El Sol Nacional for $8.5 million, the local firm said Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;The presence of the Mapfre group in this insurer completes the cycle of participation of foreign investors,&quot; said a statement from El Sol, referring to its two-year process of seeking capital from abroad.</p>
<p>The Peruvian insurance sector is currently undergoing a restructuring process involving varous mergers and share purchases by foreign companies.</p>
<p>((-- Marco Aquino, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
